			<item>
				<title>简介</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/fastapi/introdution/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/fastapi/introdution/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;fast-api&#34;&gt;Fast API&lt;a href=&#34;#fast-api&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xD;&#xA;    href=&#34;https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/zh/&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xD;&#xA;  &gt;FastAPI&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; : 是一个用于构建 API 的现代、快速（高性能）的 web 框架，&lt;strong&gt;天生支持 Python 异步特性&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>CRUD</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/fastapi/crud/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/fastapi/crud/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;概念&#34;&gt;概念&lt;a href=&#34;#%e6%a6%82%e5%bf%b5&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;FastAPI&lt;/code&gt; 是用于快速开发 &lt;code&gt;Restful API&lt;/code&gt; 范式的 HTTP 服务框架，因此，服务 API 接口设计应当符合 &lt;code&gt;CRUD(Create Read Update Delete)&lt;/code&gt; 规范。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>路由</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/fastapi/route/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/fastapi/route/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;接口文档&#34;&gt;接口文档&lt;a href=&#34;#%e6%8e%a5%e5%8f%a3%e6%96%87%e6%a1%a3&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;FastAPI 中请求方式都是基于 Python 的「装饰器」实现，且可在装饰器中配置 &lt;code&gt;Swagger UI&lt;/code&gt; 的文档信息。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
